{"id":"vnov_","lemma":"вновь","pos":"adv","rank":934,"glosses":["again, once again","newly, recently"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/8e/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%8C.ogg/Ru-%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE%D0%B2%D1%8C.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Хочу вновь увидеть тебя.","en":"I want to see you again.","words":[{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"to see"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Я бы хотел увидеть их вновь.","en":"I'd like to see them again.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"would"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to see"},{"g":"them / their"},null]},{"text":"Хочу вновь с вами увидеться.","en":"I want to see you again.","words":[{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"},{"g":"to see each other"}]},{"text":"Они никогда не встретятся вновь.","en":"They would never meet again.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"never, nevermore"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to meet","l":"встретиться"},null]},{"text":"Том вновь совершил ту же ошибку.","en":"Tom made the same mistake again.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to accomplish","l":"совершить"},{"g":"the sound of a train…"},{"g":"(emphasis)"},null]}]}